DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Äh, he he he!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ich hab etwas {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Medizin
{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}getrunken und fühl mich viel besser!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Bald bin ich gesund, tralala!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Después de tomar {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}medicina{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡he recuperado el apetito!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
¿Y ahora qué me como?

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Depuis que j'ai pris un {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}remède{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
mon appétit est revenu !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} J'ai une
faim de loup, {{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}¡Ah!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} ¡Oye! ¡Eso ya no era un
estornudo, era un estornudito!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Ya estoy mejorando,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}La {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}medicina{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} che mi hai dato
funziona che è una meraviglia!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Guarirò in men che non si dica!

DE:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} hat mir {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Medizin{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
gegeben.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Jetzt wird bestimmt
alles gut,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ich muss mich jetzt nur noch mit
'ner Portion {{TAG:0005:0013:0000}}
stärken,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} dann bin ich wieder fit!

TRANSLATION:
Bana o {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}ilacı verdiklerine
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}göre iyi olacağım galiba. {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Şimdi gücümü toplamak için
{{TAG:0005:0013:0000}} biraz yemek 
yemem {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}yeter; sonra sapasağlamım!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Maintenant que j'ai pris un {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}remède{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},
j'ai retrouvé l'appétit,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ora che ho preso la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}medicina{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},
mi si è riaperto lo stomaco,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}! Mitico!!!
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Questo brutto raffreddore però
non vuole proprio lasciarmi in pace,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}İlaçtan sonra {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}neredeyse{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} 
tam bir öğün yiyebilecek gibi
 hissediyorum{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}! Yine de soğuk algınlığını 
tamamen atlatmadım{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Dopo aver preso la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}medicina{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
è meglio che non faccia
troppi sforzi!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Anche se,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} conoscendomi,
non credo sarà un problema!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Questo raffreddore non vuole
saperne di lasciarmi in pace.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Non sono ancora guarito del tutto.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}İlacımı {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}içtim; {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}bugün yapabileceğim
tek şey sakin takılmak galiba.
{{TAG:0003:0021:}} Neyse ki sakin takılma işinde
 {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000A:}}profesyonelim! Ama bu soğuk {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
algınlığı inatçı; daha bitmedi gibi{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Forza {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}medicina{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
